  "content": "此模组为<a title=\"Just Enough Items\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\"><strong>JEI</strong></a>新增了一项功能。该功能允许玩家查看每个村民职业所需的工作方块。<br>\n<br>\n使用方法：对绿宝石或村民刷怪蛋按下JEI的用途键（默认：U），即可显示所有村民职业列表。若想了解某个职业来自哪个模组，可按住Shift键，该职业前会显示其模组ID。<br>\n<br>\n如需<a title=\"Roughly Enough Items\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-items\"><strong>REI</strong> </a>对应版本，请参阅<a title=\"Roughly Enough Professions (REP)\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/roughly-enough-professions-rep\">Roughly Enough Professions (REP)</a><br>\n<br>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz合作伙伴\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.akliz.net/mrbysco\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器？使用优惠码\"mrbysco\"首月可享八折优惠</a></p>\n \n<b>如有疑问，欢迎加入我的Discord频道。</b>\n\n## 想支持我们吗？ ##\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/ShyNieke\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>",
